        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Wolverine Rage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, emotion, mental)\n\nThe wolverine enters a state of pure rage that lasts either for 1 minute, until there are no enemies it can perceive, or until it falls unconscious, whichever comes first. While raging, the wolverine has AC 17, its jaws Strike deals 1d8+7 damage, and its claw Strike deals 1d6+7 damage. While raging, the wolverine can't use actions that have the concentrate trait, except for Seek.\n\nAfter it's stopped raging, a wolverine can't use Wolverine Rage again for 1 minute."
            },
